# API Flow Examples

## Example: CRM Update Flow

1. AI identifies customer intent.
2. Business logic validates the request.
3. Webhook sends structured payload.
4. CRM record is updated.
5. Slack alert is sent.
6. Audit log is created.

## Example Request

```http
POST /webhooks/customer-action
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>
{
  "customer_email": "jane@example.com",
  "action": "crm_update",
  "status": "completed"
}
